  "title": "Sinbad and the Seven Voyages  — The Giant Spiders and the Ship-Swallowing Sea",
  "description": "Sinbad is trapped in a canyon of diamonds, giant spiders rule the walls, and somewhere out at sea, something is swallowing ships whole.<br><br>Season 2 of Sinbad and the Seven Voyages picks up where the first film ended. Sinbad and Tariq are stranded at the bottom of the Valley of Diamonds, a canyon no man has ever climbed out of. When two giant spiders go to war over their prey, they make a desperate escape up the canyon walls, only to face the burning desert beyond.<br><br>Reunited with their crew, they set sail again, straight into a sea of floating wreckage. Dozens of ruined ships drift in silence. No storm could have done this. Something lives beneath the surface, and it is waiting.<br><br>When the sea opens beneath them, the crew lose their ship, and one of their own. Days adrift. A storm at night. And a shore no map has ever shown, where the birds flee the forest and a voice cries for help in the dark.<br><br>If you missed, Watch Season 1 first: Sinbad and the Seven Voyages — The Sea Beast and the Valley of Diamonds <br><br>If you enjoyed this voyage, subscribe and turn on notifications so you don&apos;t miss Season 3. Tell us in the comments: who do you think is calling for help?<br><br>This film was created with AI tools by Directed by Human<br><br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/sinbad\">#Sinbad</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/arabiannights\">#ArabianNights</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/aifilm\">#AIFilm</a>",
